    {
      "name": "参数字段",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "parameter-input",
      "description": "标签和参数值在同一行；数值采用 tabular-nums。",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-parameter\"><span class=\"ds-parameter-title\">学习率 <output class=\"ds-parameter-value\">0.10</output></span><input class=\"ds-parameter-input\" type=\"number\" value=\"0.1\" step=\"0.01\" aria-label=\"学习率\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-parameter{display:block;max-width:400px;font-size:12px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;line-height:1.65;}.ds-parameter-title{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:16px;color:#5c564d}.ds-parameter-value{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:#526b88;font-weight:600}.ds-parameter-input{width:100%;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #e1dfdc;border-radius:6px;background:#fdfcf9;color:#2c2924;font:inherit;caret-color:#6f6961}.ds-parameter-input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #607c9e;outline-offset:3px;} .ds-parameter-input:disabled{opacity:.5}"
    },
    {
      "name": "会话导航",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "history-nav",
      "description": "暖灰列表，当前会话与 hover 使用相同的暖灰层级；行不收缩。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-history\" aria-label=\"会话历史\"><button class=\"ds-history-row ds-history-active\" aria-current=\"page\">三维梯度下降</button><button class=\"ds-history-row\">K-means 聚类的更新过程</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-history{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;width:248px;padding:18px;background:#f3f0e9;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;line-height:1.65;}.ds-history-row{flex-shrink:0;border:0;background:transparent;padding:10px 12px;text-align:left;color:#605c54;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer}.ds-history-row:hover,.ds-history-active{background:#e6e1d8;color:#292724}.ds-history-row:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #607c9e;outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "版本按钮",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "revision-chip",
      "description": "当前版本用冷灰蓝底与深灰蓝文字；未选中保持暖灰。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-revisions\"><button class=\"ds-revision\">版本 1</button><button class=\"ds-revision ds-revision-selected\" aria-pressed=\"true\">版本 2</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-revisions{display:flex;gap:8px;overflow:auto;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;line-height:1.65;}.ds-revision{border:1px solid transparent;background:#f1eee8;padding:5px 13px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;color:#716c64;cursor:pointer}.ds-revision-selected{color:#384f6b;background:#e7edf4;border-color:#ccd6e2}.ds-revision:hover{background:#eeeae3}.ds-revision-selected:hover{background:#e7edf4}.ds-revision:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #607c9e;outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "底部输入框",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "composer",
      "description": "暖灰面与轻微环境阴影承载连续提问；图标为内联 SVG。",
      "html": "<form class=\"ds-composer\"><textarea class=\"ds-composer-text\" rows=\"2\" aria-label=\"输入教程需求\" placeholder=\"按当前参数继续提问，或修改这个演示…\"></textarea><div class=\"ds-composer-bottom\"><span>本地交互 · 当前状态随对话同步</span><button class=\"ds-send\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"发送\"><svg width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 12 7-7 7 7M12 19V5\"/></svg></button></div></form>",
      "css": ".ds-composer{max-width:860px;background:#f1eee8;border:1px solid #e4e2de;border-radius:16px;padding:15px 17px 12px;box-shadow:0 5px 18px -12px #25352d26;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;line-height:1.65;}.ds-composer-text{display:block;resize:none;border:0;outline:none;background:none;width:100%;font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;min-height:45px;color:#39352f;caret-color:#6f6961}.ds-composer-text::placeholder{color:#6f6961}.ds-composer-text:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #607c9e;outline-offset:3px;}.ds-composer-bottom{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:10px;color:#6f6961;font-size:10px}.ds-send{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:36px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:#292724;color:#fdfcf9;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s}.ds-send:hover{background:rgba(41,39,36,.9)}.ds-send:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #607c9e;outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "三维课堂容器",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "scene",
      "description": "仅预览现有容器、角色标签与检查器；实际应用中的场景由 Three.js 几何渲染。",
      "html": "<figure class=\"ds-scene\"><div class=\"ds-scene-toolbar\">三维演示<button class=\"ds-scene-reset\">复位视角</button></div><div class=\"ds-scene-preview\"><span class=\"ds-object-label\">质心 1</span><span class=\"ds-object-label ds-object-selected\">当前参数</span><div class=\"ds-scene-hint\">拖动旋转 · 滚轮缩放 · 点击选择</div><div class=\"ds-scene-inspector\"><strong>particle-1</strong><span>当前参数</span><code>[1.2, 0.6, 0.4]</code></div></div><figcaption class=\"ds-scene-caption\">参数移动与数值更新对应。</figcaption></figure>",
      "css": ".ds-scene{margin:0;background:#f4f1ec;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;line-height:1.65;}.ds-scene-toolbar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:9px 15px;font-size:11px;color:#6d675c}.ds-scene-reset{border:0;background:transparent;color:#2c2924;border-radius:8px;padding:0 12px;height:32px;font:inherit;cursor:pointer}.ds-scene-reset:hover{background:#eeeae3}.ds-scene-reset:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #607c9e;outline-offset:3px;}.ds-scene-preview{height:220px;position:relative;display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.ds-object-label{background:#fdfcf9;color:#38342e;padding:3px 7px;font:14px system-ui;white-space:nowrap}.ds-object-selected{background:#fff0db;color:#714827}.ds-scene-hint{position:absolute;left:17px;bottom:14px;font-size:10px;color:#6f6961}.ds-scene-inspector{position:absolute;right:15px;bottom:14px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.93);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:7px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:10px;color:#635d53;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-scene-inspector strong{font-weight:600;color:#454039}.ds-scene-inspector code{font-family:\"SFMono-Regular\",Consolas,monospace}.ds-scene-caption{padding:10px 16px;font-size:11px;color:#6f6961;background:#eeebe5}"
    },
    {
      "name": "教程标签",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "lesson-tabs",
      "description": "教程、源码和状态在同一组内切换，活动项为纸面和轻阴影。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"教程视图\"><button class=\"ds-tab ds-tab-active\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\">交互教程</button><button class=\"ds-tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">源码</button><button class=\"ds-tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">状态</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-tabs{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0;height:36px;padding:3px;background:#eeeae3;border-radius:12px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;line-height:1.65;}.ds-tab{height:calc(100% - 1px);padding:4px 8px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:8px;font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:rgba(44,41,36,.6);background:transparent;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,color .15s}.ds-tab-active{background:#fdfcf9;color:#2c2924;box-shadow:0 1px 3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.1),0 1px 2px -1px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.ds-tab:hover{color:#2c2924}.ds-tab:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #607c9e;outline-offset:3px;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(41,39,36,.5)}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "暖纸算法课堂",
    "overview": "WindGen 用暖纸面、炭黑动作和低饱和数据色承载可持续修改的算法教程。熟悉的会话导航、右侧用户消息和底部输入建立连续对话；公式、数值与真实三维几何在同一条助手回复中展开。\n\n浅色表面、细边界和留白参考 OpenDesign；雾蓝、灰紫和琥珀属于本项目的教学表达。用户明确排除绿色，并要求保留 ChatGPT 式对话交互；WindGen 不冒称 OpenAI 产品。本文记录 frontend/src 已实现的系统，生产构建的样式确认了组件圆角与动画时长；它不是待实现的视觉提案。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "暖纸底面与暖灰侧栏，炭黑承载主要动作。",
      "低饱和色区分算法对象和选中状态。",
      "宽幅内联课堂，公式和数值保持可核对。",
      "中文系统字体、KaTeX 数学字体、等宽代码各司其职。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Data Color Rule",
        "body": "雾蓝、灰紫和琥珀服务于算法角色与选择反馈；不要把数据颜色扩散成整页装饰。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Numerical Clarity Rule",
        "body": "保留 KaTeX 的数学排版和数值的 tabular-nums；三维对象标签保持屏幕空间可读，不随相机距离缩成几何细节。",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Quiet Surface Rule",
        "body": "以表面色差和细边界组织深度；阴影仅辅助输入框和控件，不成为内容分隔的主体。",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do 使用暖纸、暖灰和炭黑延续现有表面与动作关系。",
      "Do 用雾蓝表示参数或轨迹、灰紫区分对象组、琥珀标识当前选中对象。",
      "Do 保留公式、表格、源码的容器内横向滚动和数值对齐。",
      "Do 保留会话历史行的高度，较长列表在导航内部滚动。",
      "Do 让三维标签在相机缩放时保持屏幕空间尺寸，并用文字和值说明颜色。",
      "Do 保留键盘可见焦点、加载/停止/恢复反馈与减少动态效果支持。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't 引入绿色主色、绿色数据角色或绿色装饰。",
      "Don't 用大块彩色背景或强阴影代替教学内容的层次。",
      "Don't 用静态示意图冒充当前实现的可旋转、可点选三维几何。",
      "Don't 让数学、表格或源码的宽度撑开手机页面。",
      "Don't 把当前紧凑的 9–11px 辅助文案提升为通用正文或未来组件的默认字号。"
    ]
  }
}
